flowchart LR
  V1[(definition v1<br/>5 000 running instances)] --> P[migration plan<br/>v1 → v2<br/>step mapping]
  P --> D[dry run<br/>instances per step,<br/>unmapped steps, conflicts]
  D -->|plan valid| X[execute in batches<br/>each instance: lock, remap step,<br/>pin v2, write history row]
  D -->|conflicts| F[fix mapping<br/>or cancel instances]
  F --> D
  X --> V2[(definition v2<br/>all instances migrated)]
  X -. per-instance failure .-> I[[incident on that instance<br/>others continue]]
